      "id": "claim_b76418fb2e334bc89fedba65a235b279",
      "statement": "internal/permission ports opencode's permission engine: rule evaluation (findLast semantics), the build/plan/yolo matrices, doom-loop detection, and the blocking ask/reply service; the service is the gate between session tool execution and tool invocation.",
