    {
      "id": "claim_075f04484f86438abc7cd4fe35e5a1f5",
      "statement": "Decision = Action has values allow/denied/ask; the rule vocabulary stored on protocol.Rule.Action (config/wire form) is allow/deny/ask (note 'deny' on a rule vs Decision Deny='denied'); Evaluate applies findLast semantics where for each resource the LAST rule whose permission matches ('*' or exact) and whose pattern glob-matches the resource decides it, any deny -> Deny, else any ask or no matching rule -> Ask, else Allow.",
