    {
      "id": "claim_91751db2f2f346ccb285203fb9c741f8",
      "statement": "The shared base rule matrix (order significant, broad rules first, narrow later): */* allow, doom_loop */* ask, external_directory */* ask, question */* deny, plan_enter */* deny, plan_exit */* deny, read * allow, read *.env ask, read *.env.* ask, read *.env.example allow; build adds question+plan_enter allow, plan adds question+plan_exit allow and external_directory allow for <dataDir>/plans/* plus edit deny and edit allow for <dataDir>/plans/*.md, and yolo is a single catch-all */* allow; LoadBuiltins errors on unknown agents while BuiltinsFor falls back to the build matrix for unknown custom agents.",
