      "id": "claim_948c8236da74405a812e79f57471319c",
      "statement": "In internal/session/tool_exec.go the engine gates tool execution before a tool runs: a Hidden check fails hidden tools immediately; checkDoom uses a sliding 3-identical window on the turn's call history so the third identical call asks before it runs; gateExternal asks once per external-directory pattern outside the session dir (the part goes running first); and coreAsk is the core permission ask with Resources/Always from tool.Patterns; any Ask error, deny, or ctx-cancel while parked finalizes the part (gateFail/failToolPart) and stops the call.",
