      "statement": "internal/tui/permission.go renders the pending-ask overlay from store.Pending (shown while non-empty, above the prompt) for the FIRST parked ask only: the permission, word-wrapped patterns, suggested Always patterns, the tool-call ref, and the hint '[1] once [2] always [3] reject'; handlePermKey owns every key while an ask is pending (1/2/3 reply once/always/reject, esc rejects locked, everything else ignored), replyPermCmd posts the reply for the first parked ask, and applyPermReply drops the answered ask on success (idempotent with permission.replied) or toasts and keeps the dialog on failure.",
